p=G.GROUP/'README.md';t=p.read_text();t=t.replace('Current revision: **R03','Previous revision: **R03',1).replace('Current previews:','R03 previews:',1);end=t.index('\n\n');note='''

Current revision: **R04 fuller spatial berry shrubs.** Four curved Blueberry canes and five Rubus canes carry connected short side shoots and inner/top crown twigs. Mature Blueberry has 54 curved leaves; mature Raspberry and Blackberry each have 89, including real three-leaflet groups. Blackberry spreads wider with broader dark leaves; Raspberry is taller with narrower lighter leaves. Fruit is distributed in depth rather than concentrated on one front plane.

The three existing leaf surfaces now use species-specific painted albedo and fine normal detail. Blueberry is smoother, while Blackberry and Raspberry retain fine venation and serrated geometry. All 154 atlas allocations, the SurfaceMask and the other 151 complete surface regions are unchanged. Seed/harvest runtime geometry, UI icons, the other 28 crop models, balances, scripts and material identity remain intact. Only berry planted meshes, their prefab bounds and the three profiles' visual fit are revised.

Current previews: `../Previews/G01_Bush_R04_BeforeAfter.png`, `../Previews/G01_Bush_R04_SpatialReview.png`, and `../Previews/G01_AppliedPreview.png`. Evidence is in `Review/Bush_R04/Completion.json`, `ArtAudit.json`, `ExportBaseline.json`, and `BindingChanges.json`. All use the same NP_Plants_Unified_01 runtime material. Editor import, Play Mode and phone profiling are not run.

For a fresh rebuild, restore the saved master in `Review/Bush_R04/Before/ArtSource/Crops/G01/Blender/`, run GIMP `paint_g01_bush_r04_gimp.py`, Blender `build_g01_bush_r04.py`, Python `capture_g01_bush_r04.py`, then `prepare_plant_unity.py --group G01` and `fit_g01_bush_r04.py`. Use `render_g01_bush_r04.py` and `verify_g01_bush_r04.py` for current previews and integrity checks. Earlier instructions below are historical revisions.
''';p.write_text(t[:end]+note+t[end:],encoding='utf-8')
